      "inputTokens": 75,
      "outputTokens": 553,
      "costUsd": 0.0050145,
      "pronunciationText": "Now find the probability that X is less than one, so this courier comes before nine. Integrate four minus x, over eight, from zero to one. That's one eighth of four minus a half, which is seven sixteenths. Just under half of the probability sits in the first hour of the four. That fits, because this density is highest at zero."
