      "inputTokens": 53,
      "outputTokens": 496,
      "costUsd": 0.0044905,
      "pronunciationText": "Last one. A continuous random variable has F of x equals four x minus x squared, over four, for x from zero to two, with F equal to zero below zero, and one above two. Find its probability density function. Pause here to answer."
    },
